  "id": "36069801985",
  "title": "2022-05-25 Meeting notes - Extend DORA data structure",
  "url": "https://i-p-e-x.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=36069801985",
  "content": "<h2><ac:emoticon ac:name=\"blue-star\" ac:emoji-shortname=\":calendar_spiral:\" ac:emoji-id=\"1f5d3\" ac:emoji-fallback=\"\\uD83D\\uDDD3\" />&nbsp;Date</h2><p><time datetime=\"2022-05-25\" /></p><h2><ac:emoticon ac:name=\"blue-star\" ac:emoji-shortname=\":busts_in_silhouette:\" ac:emoji-id=\"1f465\" ac:emoji-fallback=\"\\uD83D\\uDC65\" />&nbsp;Participants</h2><p><ac:placeholder>List meeting participants using their @ mention names</ac:placeholder></p><ul><li><p><ac:link><ri:user ri:userkey=\"8a7f80835e6f9757015e7131fd8b008a\" /></ac:link> </p></li><li><p><ac:link><ri:user ri:userkey=\"8a7f808a7b3b6ad8017b3f931ee602d6\" /></ac:link> </p></li><li><p><ac:link><ri:user ri:userkey=\"8a7f8089741f73fc0174202bba0a00bf\" /></ac:link>  </p></li></ul><h2><ac:emoticon ac:name=\"blue-star\" ac:emoji-shortname=\":goal:\" ac:emoji-id=\"1f945\" ac:emoji-fallback=\"\\uD83E\\uDD45\" />&nbsp;Goals</h2><p>Extend data collected regarding deployment frequency to cater for identification of modules as discussed with <ac:link><ri:user ri:userkey=\"8a7f808a76fcf2380177068255bb071d\" /></ac:link> in product team report. As well make the extension generic so that custom dimension to  data easily can be added by teams.</p><p /><h2>Notes</h2><p>Discussion around what type of data structure to add to payload. To keep things simple and as well very generic we concluded that a &ldquo;customInfo&rdquo;- attribute would be best way forward. This attribute would just flow as a string through the data collection pipeline and be a custom dimension for team that use it to filter on in the product report.</p><p>As a standard, that could for example be one way of identifying a subcomponent, the repository name could as well be useful to include.</p><p /><h3>New proposed keys and example payload</h3><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"19e179ce-17ab-4f5b-bfb5-3830332e61f0\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[\"repository\": \"cbf-ipex_some-product\",\n\"customInfo\": \"product specific info\"]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p /><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"5088978b-1a06-436b-bdb0-75e3914fbf40\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[{\n\"productId\": \"storage2\",\n\"action\": {\n\"id\": \"DoraLeadTime\",\n\"data\": {\n\"action\": \"stop\",\n\"reason\": \"deployed\",\n\"environment\": \"stage\",\n\"description\": \"Akamai CTE/PEE\",\n\"jira\": \"STOR2-2427\",\n\"repository\": \"cbf-ipex_some-product\",\n\"customInfo\": \"product specific info\"\n}\n},\n\"timestamp\": \"202202151418\"\n}]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p /><h3>Example of custom information attribute in pipeline:</h3><p><br />steps:</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"faa324bd-841e-46a9-9d3d-365abb8a9ed6\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">none</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[  uses: inter-ikea/cbf-re-ipex-devops-dora-metrics@v3\n    with:\n        use_changelog: 'true'\n        target_environment: 'production'\n        custom_information: 'product specific information used in product report'\n        search_tag_regexp: 'octostore-v6.*'\n    env: \n      DEVOPS_METRICS_API_KEY: ${{ secrets.DEVOPS_METRICS_API_KEY }}]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p /><ac:task-list>\n<ac:task>\n<ac:task-id>13</ac:task-id>\n<ac:task-status>complete</ac:task-status>\n<ac:task-body><span class=\"placeholder-inline-tasks\"><ac:link><ri:user ri:userkey=\"8a7f80835e6f9757015e7131fd8b008a\" /></ac:link> Align with <ac:link><ri:user ri:userkey=\"8a7f808a76fcf2380177068255bb071d\" /></ac:link>that new attributes would fulfill his requirement for filtering on modules. Please just comment here if you agree <ac:link><ri:user ri:userkey=\"8a7f808a76fcf2380177068255bb071d\" /></ac:link>   Or ping me and we can discuss further.<ac:emoticon ac:name=\"smile\" ac:emoji-shortname=\":slight_smile:\" ac:emoji-id=\"1f642\" ac:emoji-fallback=\"🙂\" /></span></ac:task-body>\n</ac:task>\n</ac:task-list>",
  "last_modified": "2022-06-20T13:12:50.982Z"
}